	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE D1:\nU32 A1212S-2WR3 (YLPTEC): input 10.8-13.2 V. Pinout per the YLPTEC datasheet: check the module label. The -12 V load (~7 mA) is under the 10 % minimum load, so that rail may sit up to 10 % high: fine for U31 and U22."
